            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Jarvis 0.19.28</h2>
<ul>
  <li>New: Mailbox. Jarvis now reads the mail and calendars already on your
      Mac (Gmail, iCloud, Outlook and others), with no Google sign-in
      screen. Find it first under Settings → Integrations.</li>
  <li>Give access once: Calendars, and Jarvis reading your inbox from Apple
      Mail. Remove either any time from the same page.</li>
  <li>Emails behind your tasks now show the Mail icon.</li>
  <li>Rename a task by clicking its title.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
